close_reason: SDK search domain decomposition verified by complete golden parity and exact coverage
body: "## Current scope\nSearch behavior resides in src/sdk/query/search.ts behind the thin CLI adapter. Split input parsing, inline filters, lexical scoring/highlights, linked and semantic corpus retrieval, and response projection while preserving query precedence and public contracts.\n\n## Historical lineage\nThe July CLI rendering and timestamp-predicate extraction was partial delivery. Append-only comments and history retain that original scope; September finishes the remaining decomposition where behavior now lives in the SDK.\n\n## Definition of done\nEach search module is below 1500 physical lines. Complete fixed-time golden envelopes remain byte-identical. Required zero-clone, SDK contract and exact 100/100/100/100 coverage gates pass."
